  "description": "FUFXEM crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H90 Er6 O30,C5 H12. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er5 (Er) has 8 O neighbors; Er6 (Er) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.539-4.371 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.73-136.10°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H90Er6O30·C5H12.",
